  "question": {
    "text": "How many type of products are obtained on thermal decomposition of alkaline earth metal nitrates.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "All alkaline earth metal nitrates decompose to form metal oxide, <math><mtext>N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math><br />So, three type of product:<br /><math> <mrow>  <mtext>2</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>M</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mfenced>     <mrow>      <msub>       <mrow>        <mtext>NO</mtext></mrow>       <mtext>3</mtext>      </msub>      </mrow>    </mfenced></mrow>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mo>&#x2192;</mo><mtext>2</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>MO</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>2</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>NO</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mo>+</mo><msub>   <mtext>O</mtext>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>(M</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Be,</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>Mg</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>Ca</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>Sr,</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>Ba)</mtext></mrow></math>",
